<text><body><div type="page" n="95"><pb n="95" facs="#f0107"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">1. Statistik.</fw>
<p xml:id="p95-b1"><lb n="1" facs="#f0107-l1"/>Landestheil <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName> 998,0 Häuser. | Landestheil <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lob.-Ebersdorf</placeName> 638,4 Häuser.<lb/>" Schleiz 621,5 " | <lb n="2" facs="#f0107-l2"/>Fürstenthum . . . . . 727,9 "</p>
<p xml:id="p95-b2"><lb n="3" facs="#f0107-l3"/>Die Besetzung des Landes mit Häusern ist demnach am stärksten im Landes<lb n="4" break="no" facs="#f0107-l4"/>theile <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName>, am schwächsten in <placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName>, im Ganzen aber anderen Ländern gegen<lb n="5" break="no" facs="#f0107-l5"/>über keine geringe, denn es besitzt unter Andern auf 1 ☐ Meile:<lb/><lb n="6" facs="#f0107-l6"/><placeName ref="#place-belgien">Belgien</placeName> . . . . . 1556 Häuser, <placeName ref="#place-grossherzogthum-baden">Baden</placeName> . . . . . . 647 Häuser,<lb/><lb n="7" facs="#f0107-l7"/><placeName ref="#place-sachsen">Sachsen</placeName> . . . . . 869 " <placeName ref="#place-wuertemberg">Württemberg</placeName> . . . 613 "<lb/><lb n="8" facs="#f0107-l8"/><placeName ref="#place-fuerstenthum-reuss-juengerer-linie">Reuß j. L.</placeName> . . . . 727,9 " Beide <placeName ref="#place-schwarzburg">Schwarzburg</placeName> . 573 "<lb/><lb n="9" facs="#f0107-l9"/><placeName ref="#place-herzogthum-sachsen-coburg-gotha">Coburg-Gotha</placeName> . . . 665 " <placeName ref="#place-bayern">Bayern</placeName> . . . . . . 447 "</p>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="p95-b3" facs="#f0107-b3"><lb n="10" facs="#f0107-l10"/>5) Vergleichung der städtischen und ländlichen Bevölkerung: <lb n="11" facs="#f0107-l11"/>Die Bevölkerung des Fürstenthums vertheilt sich auf Stadt und Land:</ab>
<table xml:id="p95-b4" facs="#f0107-b4" rows="25" cols="7"><row role="label"><cell role="label">Jahre.</cell><cell role="label">Städte.</cell><cell role="label">Landorte.</cell><cell role="label">Summe der Bevölkerung</cell><cell role="label">Procente der Gesammtbevölkerung städtische.</cell><cell role="label">Procente der Gesammtbevölkerung ländliche.</cell><cell role="label">Namen der Städte.</cell></row><row role="label"><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label">Landrathsbezirk <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName>.</cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"></cell></row><row><cell>1833</cell><cell>10272</cell><cell>16294</cell><cell>26566</cell><cell>38,66</cell><cell>61,34</cell><cell><placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName>.</cell></row><row><cell>1843</cell><cell>11510</cell><cell>17679</cell><cell>29189</cell><cell>39,43</cell><cell>60,57</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>1852</cell><cell>13060</cell><cell>19318</cell><cell>32378</cell><cell>40,34</cell><cell>59,66</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>1864</cell><cell>15363</cell><cell>21435</cell><cell>36798</cell><cell>41,75</cell><cell>58,25</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>1867</cell><cell>16283</cell><cell>21969</cell><cell>38252</cell><cell>42,57</cell><cell>57,43</cell><cell></cell></row><row role="label"><cell cols="7">Landrathsbezirk <placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName>.</cell></row><row><cell>1833</cell><cell>6966</cell><cell>14940</cell><cell>21906</cell><cell>31,80</cell><cell>68,20</cell><cell><placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-saalburg">Saalburg</placeName> u. <placeName ref="#place-tanna">Tanna</placeName>.</cell></row><row><cell>1843</cell><cell>7769</cell><cell>16376</cell><cell>24145</cell><cell>32,18</cell><cell>67,82</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>1852</cell><cell>7726</cell><cell>17348</cell><cell>25074</cell><cell>30,81</cell><cell>69,19</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>1864</cell><cell>7821</cell><cell>19354</cell><cell>27175</cell><cell>28,78</cell><cell>71,22</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>1867</cell><cell>7968</cell><cell>19400</cell><cell>27368</cell><cell>29,11</cell><cell>70,89</cell><cell></cell></row><row role="label"><cell cols="7">Landrathsbezirk <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lobenstein-Ebersdorf</placeName>.</cell></row><row><cell>1833</cell><cell>4894</cell><cell>15371</cell><cell>20265</cell><cell>24,15</cell><cell>75,85</cell><cell>Lobenstein und <placeName ref="#place-hirschberg">Hirschberg</placeName>.</cell></row><row><cell>1843</cell><cell>5164</cell><cell>16385</cell><cell>21549</cell><cell>23,96</cell><cell>76,04</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>1852</cell><cell>5312</cell><cell>17060</cell><cell>22372</cell><cell>23,74</cell><cell>76,26</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>1864</cell><cell>4612</cell><cell>17887</cell><cell>22499</cell><cell>20,50</cell><cell>79,50</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>1867</cell><cell>4671</cell><cell>17683</cell><cell>22354</cell><cell>20,89</cell><cell>79,11</cell><cell></cell></row><row role="label"><cell cols="7">Das Fürstenthum.</cell></row><row><cell>1833</cell><cell>22132</cell><cell>46605</cell><cell>68737</cell><cell>32,20</cell><cell>67,80</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>1843</cell><cell>24443</cell><cell>50440</cell><cell>74883</cell><cell>32,64</cell><cell>67,36</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>1852</cell><cell>26098</cell><cell>53726</cell><cell>79824</cell><cell>32,69</cell><cell>67,31</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>1864</cell><cell>27796</cell><cell>58676</cell><cell>86472</cell><cell>32,14</cell><cell>67,86</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>1867</cell><cell>28922</cell><cell>58052</cell><cell>87974</cell><cell>32,87</cell><cell>67,13</cell><cell></cell></row></table>
<p xml:id="p95-b5"><lb n="25" facs="#f0107-l25"/>Demnach beträgt die städtische Bevölkerung 1/3, die ländliche 2/3 der <lb n="26" facs="#f0107-l26"/>Gesammtbevölkerung des Landes; auch ist dies Verhältniß in den letzten 34 <lb n="27" facs="#f0107-l27"/>Jahren ein fast unveränderliches geblieben, obschon die einzelnen Bezirke eine sehr <lb n="28" facs="#f0107-l28"/>ungleiche Zu- oder Abnahme der Bevölkerung in Stadt und Land aufweisen. <lb n="29" facs="#f0107-l29"/>Im Bezirk <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName> überwucherte die Stadt <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName> den ländlichen Volkskörper in <lb n="30" facs="#f0107-l30"/>der Art, daß in der Zeit von 1833—1867 dort die Bevölkerung um 4,02</p>
</div></body></text>
